		"title": "決策模型",
		"type": "doc",
		"updated": "20260920123707"
	},
	"Children": [
		{
			"ID": "20260920122941-41jh42y",
			"Type": "NodeHeading",
			"HeadingLevel": 2,
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260920122941-41jh42y",
				"updated": "20260920123707"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "概述"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260920122941-ihm3tk3",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260920122941-ihm3tk3",
				"updated": "20260920122941"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "智能體會優先將標準明確、重複的分類、篩選和評分任務交給 TypeSafe System One（Jev）。例如，要求智能體依指定標準評估選取文件與研究問題的相關程度。智能體可以直接傳遞區塊 ID，由核心讀取完整內文，減少主模型重複輸出內文的負擔。無須啟用嵌入或重排模型。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260920123707-z1tozow",
			"Type": "NodeHeading",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260920123707-z1tozow",
				"updated": "20260920123707"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "設定方式"
				}
			],
			"HeadingLevel": 2
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260920122941-2h90hjs",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260920122941-2h90hjs",
				"updated": "20260920122941"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "在 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "設定"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " - "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "人工智能"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " - "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "決策模型"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " 中填寫介面位址、API 金鑰、模型名稱和請求逾時，測試連線後啟用。預設關閉，介面位址為 https://api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone，模型為 jev-latest，逾時為 30 秒。關閉後保留設定。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260920123707-nnwx8ao",
			"Type": "NodeHeading",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260920123707-nnwx8ao",
				"updated": "20260920123707"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "結果說明"
				}
			],
			"HeadingLevel": 2
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260920122941-fl4ev86",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260920122941-fl4ev86",
				"updated": "20260920122941"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "主模型仍負責理解需求、複雜推理、工具選擇和最終回答。評分可能介於兩個等級之間，機率和信心度不代表結果一定正確。失敗和未處理的項目會個別標示，已完成的結果會保留，請求不會自動重試。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260920123707-sgt2wba",
			"Type": "NodeHeading",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260920123707-sgt2wba",
				"updated": "20260920123707"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "內容與權限"
				}
			],
			"HeadingLevel": 2
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260920122941-hyptw2z",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260920122941-hyptw2z",
				"updated": "20260920122941"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "相關內容會傳送至設定的決策服務，可能產生費用。工具呼叫沿用既有的能力確認策略。加密筆記本必須先解鎖，引用其中的區塊還需要提供筆記本 ID。連線測試使用固定範例，不讀取筆記內容。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260920122941-5j2mjsr",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260920122941-5j2mjsr",
				"updated": "20260920122941"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "服務與介面文件："
				},
